WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.875
One of the more difficult things
that we have to do as leaders

00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:05.083
is let go.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:10.708
In 2006, I had to take extreme ownership
over a friendly fire incident.

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:12.583
There was only
one person to blame,

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:14.166
and that person was me.

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:16.625
I spent my adult life in the military,

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:18.041
20 years special operations.

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:22.000
I've learned that leadership is the most
important thing on the battlefield.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.000
It's the most important thing in business,

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.250
and really, it's the most
important thing in life.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.125
What do you think
makes a good leader?

00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:29.041
Cultivating the best
out of people.

00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:30.000
Yes, what else?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.666
No matter what your job is,

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.750
these skills will help you
in every aspect of your life.

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:37.833
I'm Jocko Willink,

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:41.208
and this is MasterClass.

